\[0.01(1) = 0.01 \cdot \frac{1 \cdot 2}{2}.\]Hence, the total area of the region is
\[\frac{0.01}{2} (1 \cdot 2 + 2 \cdot 3 + 3 \cdot 4 + \dots + 100 \cdot 101) = \frac{1}{200} \sum_{k = 1}^{100} k(k + 1).\]To compute this sum, we can use the formula
